# json_output_test.tcyr — JSON serialization (json_out.cyr, cost_to_json).
#
# Every emitted document is parsed back with bayan (2.5.5): through 2.5.4
# these tests matched substrings only, so an unescaped name, a trailing
# comma or a duplicate key passed. bayan refuses all three.

